    "body": "LOGICAL_AGENT = DUNCAN\nROLE = INDEPENDENT TECH/QC\nASSIGNED_BY = JINGO\nSTATE = ASSIGNED / QC AUTHORIZED\n\n## AUTHORITIES\nIMPLEMENTATION_ISSUE = #74\nUMBRELLA = #73\nSPEC_HEAD = c20126f949e6e61298d9dd76a906349a71bbcb00\nPLAN_HEAD = 79cc49159618a1a959dfa087941ad9a95eb0ab45\nIMPLEMENTATION_BRANCH = agent-controller/daemon-v1-implementation\nEXACT_HEAD = 24a8042df32d4e19c8abf0864bb72cf843150793\nLESTER_READY_COMMENT = #74 comment 5434953849\n\n## INDEPENDENCE LAW\nDUNCAN reviews the exact implementation HEAD independently. Lester self-verification is evidence, not independent QC.\n`IMPLEMENTER MAY VERIFY ITS WORK; IMPLEMENTER MAY NOT SELF-AWARD INDEPENDENT QC PASS.`\nAny code/content change after this exact HEAD invalidates this QC verdict and requires re-QC.\n\n## REQUIRED REVIEW\nReview exact diff `79cc49159618a1a959dfa087941ad9a95eb0ab45..24a8042df32d4e19c8abf0864bb72cf843150793` against approved spec/plan and #74 contract.\n\nVerify at minimum:\n1. daemonRuntimeRoot contract and OS-backed global instance lock;\n2. global lock applies to `--once`, `--daemon`, and legacy continuous task-processing modes; standalone `--daemon-preflight` does not own execution lock and does not process tasks;\n3. startup order remains `CONFIG -> GITHUB ADAPTER -> GLOBAL LOCK -> HEALTH/LOGGER -> STARTING -> PREFLIGHT -> BACKENDS/CONTROLLER -> DAEMON LOOP`;\n4. atomic health.json, schema/state semantics, config SHA, heartbeat evidence, rotating UTF-8 logs at 2 MiB x 5;\n5. preflight is non-mutating with respect to GitHub tasks/ComfyUI and fails closed on bad config/runtime/Python/GitHub auth;\n6. daemon runner HEALTHY/DEGRADED/FATAL/STOPPING behavior and retry/fatal semantics;\n7. Windows Task Scheduler deployment contract: current-user interactive token, `RunLevel Limited`, no plaintext password, `IgnoreNew`, StartWhenAvailable, restart exactly 1 minute x5, execution time limit disabled, battery-safe, no service/NSSM/elevation fallback;\n8. install/update/control/status behavior is idempotent/fail-closed as specified; status never processes tasks and reports stale/missing health correctly;\n9. accepted controller task-state semantics remain unchanged;\n10. SALVADOR model/profile/workflow/prompt/denoise/dimensions/backends are unchanged;\n11. Reference Bridge, ComfyUI lifecycle management, Babylon, canon mutation, merge, and production activation remain OUT;\n12. changed-file scope matches approved daemon-v1 plan; no hidden scope expansion.\n\n## REQUIRED FRESH VERIFICATION\nFrom `agent-controller/` on EXACT_HEAD run independently:\n- `python -m pytest -q`\n- `python -m compileall -q src`\n- focused daemon tests individually: `test_config.py`, `test_instance_lock.py`, `test_daemon_health.py`, `test_daemon_runner.py`, `test_cli.py`, `test_windows_deploy.py`\n- changed-file/scope review against PLAN_HEAD\n- code-level review for race/error/security/Windows Task Scheduler edge cases not proven by tests\n\nDo not merely repeat Lester's reported numbers; execute/inspect independently where environment allows. If an environment-specific Windows live behavior cannot be proven without owner-PC smoke, mark it `SMOKE_REQUIRED` rather than inventing PASS. The later owner-PC live smoke remains a separate gate.\n\n## VERDICT\nReturn exactly one:\n`DUNCAN_DAEMON_V1_QC_PASS`\nor\n`DUNCAN_DAEMON_V1_CHANGES_REQUIRED`\n\nPASS handoff must include:\nEXACT_HEAD = 24a8042df32d4e19c8abf0864bb72cf843150793\nPLAN_HEAD = 79cc49159618a1a959dfa087941ad9a95eb0ab45\nTESTS = <fresh exact result>\nCOMPILE = <result>\nFOCUSED = <result>\nSCOPE = PASS/FAIL\nINSTANCE_LOCK = PASS/FAIL\nHEALTH_LOGGING = PASS/FAIL\nPREFLIGHT = PASS/FAIL\nDAEMON_RUNNER = PASS/FAIL\nCLI_GLOBAL_LOCK = PASS/FAIL\nWINDOWS_DEPLOY_CONTRACT = PASS/FAIL/SMOKE_REQUIRED\nSALVADOR_SCOPE_INTEGRITY = PASS/FAIL\nFINDINGS = NONE or exact findings\nLIVE_OWNER_PC_SMOKE = NOT RUN / NEXT GATE IF PASS\nMERGE = NO\nPRODUCTION_ACTIVATION = NO\nNEXT = JINGO\n\nIf CHANGES_REQUIRED, list each finding with severity, exact path/behavior, violated requirement, and minimum repair. Do not authorize live smoke.\n\n## FORBIDDEN\n- modifying implementation while acting as reviewer;\n- merge;\n- owner-PC Task Scheduler live smoke inside this QC;\n- production activation;\n- Reference Bridge work;\n- SALVADOR profile/model/workflow changes.\n",
